Make this folder inside your world:

 /datapacks/my wolf swords/

Put a pack.mcmeta in it:


{
 "pack": { "pack format": 15, "description": "Extra wolf swords" }
}


Then create data/wolfswordmod/tags/items/swords.json inside that same folder and list the items you want, using the id shown by pressing F3+H in game:


{
 "replace": false,
 "values": [
 "somemod:ruby sword",
 "othermod:cursed blade"
 ]
}


